    skill_metadata {
      name: "frontend-design"
      description: "Universal design constitution and domain-specific architectural guidelines for building distinctive, production-grade frontend web applications. Use when building or restyling websites, landing pages, SaaS dashboards, e-commerce stores, games (2D/casual), 3D spatial apps (Three.js/WebGL), educational simulations, mobile web apps, scientific tools, or creative portfolios. Enforces anti-AI slop rules, zero-pill discipline, typographic hierarchy, viewport presence, and high-fidelity image asset generation. This skill already covers the full generate_image workflow and prompt guidelines\342\200\224do NOT also read the image-generation skill when loading frontend-design."
    }
