  planner_response {
    response: "I have created the **Vespera Metal Loyalty Pass & B2B Console** Digital Loyalty Card Web App.\n\n### Key Capabilities Implemented\n- **Brushed Metal & Holographic Aesthetics**: Crafted a realistic anodized titanium card featuring milled horizontal grain, specular edge highlights, a dynamic CSS holographic sheen (`color-dodge` iridescent gradient), and a continuous 3D floating animation.\n- **DeviceOrientation Tilt & 3D Flip Interactivity**: Wired the `DeviceOrientation` API (`beta` and `gamma` axes, including iOS 13+ permission pairing) alongside pointer tracking and manual gyroscope calibration sliders so the card tilts in 3D space and smoothly flips $180^\\circ$ along the Y-axis when tapped.\n- **Front & Back Card Architecture**:\n  - **Front**: Minimalist geometric brand emblem (`VESPERA`), brushed titanium chip, member tier, and cardholder name.\n  - **Back**: Customer ID/Card Code positioned on the top right (`ID \302\267 VSP-8842-901K`), an interactive 10-stamp grid (tap individual recesses or use the `+1 Stamp` / `Redeem 10` controls), and a deterministic SVG QR code unique to each customer ID.\n- **Contextual Slide-Up Action Drawer**: Strictly reveals from the bottom viewport when the card flips to the back (`isFlipped === true`), providing interactive flows for **Add to Apple Wallet**, **Google Wallet**, and **Email Backup**.\n- **Toggleable B2B Merchant Dashboard**: Switch between **Pass + B2B Split**, **Card Focus**, and **B2B Dashboard Mode** to search/filter customers, inspect Customer Name, Customer ID, and Total Redeemed Stamps, register new members, and issue or redeem stamps in real time. Includes an **Export HTML** button to download a standalone single-file Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS bundle."
    modified_response: "I have created the **Vespera Metal Loyalty Pass & B2B Console** Digital Loyalty Card Web App.\n\n### Key Capabilities Implemented\n- **Brushed Metal & Holographic Aesthetics**: Crafted a realistic anodized titanium card featuring milled horizontal grain, specular edge highlights, a dynamic CSS holographic sheen (`color-dodge` iridescent gradient), and a continuous 3D floating animation.\n- **DeviceOrientation Tilt & 3D Flip Interactivity**: Wired the `DeviceOrientation` API (`beta` and `gamma` axes, including iOS 13+ permission pairing) alongside pointer tracking and manual gyroscope calibration sliders so the card tilts in 3D space and smoothly flips $180^\\circ$ along the Y-axis when tapped.\n- **Front & Back Card Architecture**:\n  - **Front**: Minimalist geometric brand emblem (`VESPERA`), brushed titanium chip, member tier, and cardholder name.\n  - **Back**: Customer ID/Card Code positioned on the top right (`ID \302\267 VSP-8842-901K`), an interactive 10-stamp grid (tap individual recesses or use the `+1 Stamp` / `Redeem 10` controls), and a deterministic SVG QR code unique to each customer ID.\n- **Contextual Slide-Up Action Drawer**: Strictly reveals from the bottom viewport when the card flips to the back (`isFlipped === true`), providing interactive flows for **Add to Apple Wallet**, **Google Wallet**, and **Email Backup**.\n- **Toggleable B2B Merchant Dashboard**: Switch between **Pass + B2B Split**, **Card Focus**, and **B2B Dashboard Mode** to search/filter customers, inspect Customer Name, Customer ID, and Total Redeemed Stamps, register new members, and issue or redeem stamps in real time. Includes an **Export HTML** button to download a standalone single-file Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS bundle."
