  planner_response {
    response: "The 3D Digital Loyalty Card back face CSS and layout have been refactored:\n\n- **Fixed CSS Mirroring & Front-Face Bleed-Through**: Separated the 3D transform planes (`.card-face-front-plane` at `rotateY(0deg) translateZ(2px)` and `.card-face-back-plane` at `rotateY(180deg) translateZ(2px)`) from the inner `.card-surface-shell` containers (`overflow: hidden`) with strict `backface-visibility: hidden` and synchronized opacity transitions so the back face reads left-to-right with zero mirrored bleed-through from the front logo.\n- **Compact 2\303\2275 Stamp Grid (Zero Overlap)**: Reduced the stamp recesses (`w-8 h-8 sm:w-9 sm:h-9` with `w-3.5 h-3.5` icons) in a centered 2-row \303\227 5-column grid separated cleanly between the top header row and bottom status/QR bar.\n- **Dynamic Scannable QR Code (`react-qr-code`)**: Integrated `react-qr-code` to dynamically generate a real, camera-scannable QR code from the user\'s Anonymous Customer ID (`activeCustomer.id`), enclosed in a solid white padded container (`bg-white p-2 rounded-lg`) inset safely inside the card\'s bottom-right corner."
    modified_response: "The 3D Digital Loyalty Card back face CSS and layout have been refactored:\n\n- **Fixed CSS Mirroring & Front-Face Bleed-Through**: Separated the 3D transform planes (`.card-face-front-plane` at `rotateY(0deg) translateZ(2px)` and `.card-face-back-plane` at `rotateY(180deg) translateZ(2px)`) from the inner `.card-surface-shell` containers (`overflow: hidden`) with strict `backface-visibility: hidden` and synchronized opacity transitions so the back face reads left-to-right with zero mirrored bleed-through from the front logo.\n- **Compact 2\303\2275 Stamp Grid (Zero Overlap)**: Reduced the stamp recesses (`w-8 h-8 sm:w-9 sm:h-9` with `w-3.5 h-3.5` icons) in a centered 2-row \303\227 5-column grid separated cleanly between the top header row and bottom status/QR bar.\n- **Dynamic Scannable QR Code (`react-qr-code`)**: Integrated `react-qr-code` to dynamically generate a real, camera-scannable QR code from the user\'s Anonymous Customer ID (`activeCustomer.id`), enclosed in a solid white padded container (`bg-white p-2 rounded-lg`) inset safely inside the card\'s bottom-right corner."
