    user_response: "Fix the preview crash by completely removing the react-qr-code npm package and any of its imports. Instead, render the dynamic QR code using a standard <img /> tag. Set its src attribute to a public API endpoint, such as [https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=150x150&data=$](https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=150x150&data=$){encodeURIComponent(activeCustomer.id)}. Ensure there are no uninstalled third-party dependencies so the StackBlitz preview loads successfully."
    items {
      text: "Fix the preview crash by completely removing the react-qr-code npm package and any of its imports. Instead, render the dynamic QR code using a standard <img /> tag. Set its src attribute to a public API endpoint, such as [https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=150x150&data=$](https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=150x150&data=$){encodeURIComponent(activeCustomer.id)}. Ensure there are no uninstalled third-party dependencies so the StackBlitz preview loads successfully."
