  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals: Frontend**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the three uploaded images, trying to parse their implications for frontend design. I\'m leveraging my existing understanding of frontend principles. I\'ve already revisited relevant skills. My analysis involves considering the visual elements and their potential functionality, which I\'m aligning with frontend best practices.\n\n\n**Refining Image Integration**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the direct integration of the provided images, keeping user instructions at the forefront. Specifically, I\'m analyzing how to accurately translate the visual layout of the loyalty card\'s back face into a CSS Grid or absolute positioning, focusing on stamp placements. I\'m taking the \"TEMPAT QR CODE\" box into consideration as a key area.\n\n\n**Implementing Image Paths**\n\nI\'ve realized I can streamline image pathing with `run_command`. I\'ll copy the images from their original AI Studio location to `public/`. This allows me to use paths like `public/kartu-depan.png` directly, avoiding complex adjustments. I\'ll extract the stamp icon from the stamped back card as well, to align with the dynamic overlay logic I\'m building.\n\n\n**Extracting Visual Coordinates**\n\nI\'m now focused on obtaining precise visual data. I plan to use a `run_command` script to copy and rename the images. Crucially, I\'ll extract the exact pixel coordinates for the eight circles and the QR code box from the background image. The script will also create a transparent stamp icon image, so I\'m focusing on the dimensions.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_411330"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"node -e \'\\nconst fs = require(\\\"fs\\\");\\nconst zlib = require(\\\"zlib\\\");\\n\\nfs.copyFileSync(\\\"public/assets/aistudio/kartu_depan_101f4ead.png\\\", \\\"public/kartu-depan.png\\\");\\nfs.copyFileSync(\\\"public/assets/aistudio/kartu_belakang_sebelum_stampel_e3d362fc.png\\\", \\\"public/kartu-belakang-kosong.png\\\");\\n\\nfunction readPngDimensions(path) {\\n  const buf = fs.readFileSync(path);\\n  const w = buf.readUInt32BE(16);\\n  const h = buf.readUInt32BE(20);\\n  const bitDepth = buf[24];\\n  const colorType = buf[25];\\n  return { w, h, bitDepth, colorType };\\n}\\n\\nconsole.log(\\\"Depan:\\\", readPngDimensions(\\\"public/kartu-depan.png\\\"));\\nconsole.log(\\\"Belakang kosong:\\\", readPngDimensions(\\\"public/kartu-belakang-kosong.png\\\"));\\nconsole.log(\\\"Belakang stamped:\\\", readPngDimensions(\\\"public/assets/aistudio/kartu_belakang_a1c1455d.png\\\"));\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\".\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":5000, \"toolAction\":\"Inspecting PNG dimensions and copying card assets to /public\", \"toolSummary\":\"Copy card assets and inspect PNG dimensions\"}"
