    thinking: "**Verifying Filter Results**\n\nI\'ve been experimenting with a specific masking technique. If I isolate areas where a dark pixel exists and none of its immediate neighbors (at a 4px radius) in the \"stamped\" image are thick strokes, I find that `/public/stamp-icon.png` reveals the latte art perfectly, entirely devoid of the thin circle outline. I\'m currently running a 1-second filter on `/public/stamp` to confirm these observations.\n\n\n"
