  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Update the dynamic stamp grid rendering logic on the back face of the 3D Digital Loyalty Card in `/app/page.tsx`.\n   - **Specific Requirements**:\n     - Modify the `.map()` function rendering the 8 stamp slots on the back face of the card so active stamps alternate between two separate transparent PNG assets in `/public`: `/stamp-roti.png` and `/stamp-kopi.png`.\n     - Use a modulo operator (`index % 2 === 0`) so that even-indexed stamps display `/stamp-roti.png` and odd-indexed stamps display `/stamp-kopi.png`.\n     - Keep the CSS grid positioning (`left: \'14.45%\'`, `top: \'31.06%\'`, `width: \'71.07%\'`, `height: \'44.20%\'`, `columnGap: \'4.15%\'`, `rowGap: \'14.80%\'`), the custom background images (`/kartu-depan.png` and `/kartu-belakang-kosong.png`), the unique Customer ID (`activeCustomer.id`), and the dynamic QR code (`https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=150x150&data=${encodeURIComponent(\'https://api.merchant-system.com/scan?id=\' + activeCustomer.id)}`) intact without any layout changes.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed Previously**:\n     - Built the Next.js 15 App Router 3D Digital Loyalty Card Web App in `/app/page.tsx` with `DeviceOrientation` gyroscope tilt, 3D flip animation, holographic overlay, B2B dashboard mode, Bahasa Indonesia (`id`) / English (`en`) localization, anonymous `localStorage` Customer ID generation & persistence, and PWA support (`/app/manifest.ts`, `/public/sw.js`, `/public/icon.svg`, `/public/pwa-192x192.png`, `/public/pwa-512x512.png`, `/public/pwa-maskable-512x512.png`, `/public/apple-touch-icon.png`).\n     - Extracted and copied custom Sissi Heritage card assets into `/public/kartu-depan.png` and `/public/kartu-belakang-kosong.png`.\n     - Extracted transparent PNG stamp assets `/public/stamp-roti.png` (croissant stamp) and `/public/stamp-kopi.png` (latte art cup stamp) from `/public/assets/aistudio/kartu_belakang_a1c1455d.png` via `run_command`.\n   - **Skills Read**:\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/10_mobile_touch_apps.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/pwa_integration/SKILL.md`\n   - **In Progress**:\n     - Updating `/app/page.tsx` so `STAMP_SLOTS.map((slot, index) => ...)` renders `<img src={index % 2 === 0 ? \'/stamp-roti.png\' : \'/stamp-kopi.png\'} ... />` (and updating the exported single-file HTML string in `handleDownloadSingleFileHtml` to match), followed by running `compile_applet`.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - In `/app/page.tsx` around lines 955\342\200\223986 (and in `handleDownloadSingleFileHtml` around lines 610\342\200\223626), `STAMP_SLOTS.map((slot) => ...)` currently renders `/stamp-icon.png` for all active stamps.\n   - Changing `STAMP_SLOTS.map((slot, index) => ...)` to select `const stampSrc = index % 2 === 0 ? \'/stamp-roti.png\' : \'/stamp-kopi.png\';` satisfies the user\'s exact specification (`index % 2 === 0` -> `/stamp-roti.png`, odd `index` -> `/stamp-kopi.png`) while keeping all CSS grid coordinates, background images, Customer ID, and QR code untouched.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - Earlier in the session, the user noted that `react-qr-code` caused a StackBlitz preview issue if uninstalled in external previews; it was removed from `/package.json` and `/app/page.tsx` in favor of a standard `<img />` tag pointing to `https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=150x150&data=${encodeURIComponent(\'https://api.merchant-system.com/scan?id=\' + activeCustomer.id)}`. Do not re-introduce third-party QR packages.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - `/public/kartu-depan.png`, `/public/kartu-belakang-kosong.png`, `/public/stamp-roti.png`, and `/public/stamp-kopi.png` are all present in `/public`.\n   - `/app/page.tsx` is ready to be updated with `replace_file_content`.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. Use `view_file` on `/app/page.tsx` around lines 600\342\200\2231010 (or `multi_replace_file_content` / `replace_file_content` after viewing exact line numbers) to update the `.map()` function in `/app/page.tsx` so `index % 2 === 0` renders `/stamp-roti.png` and odd `index` renders `/stamp-kopi.png`.\n   2. Run `compile_applet` to verify the build succeeds with zero errors.\n   3. Summarize the change concisely for the user.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Keep the CSS grid positioning, custom background images (`/kartu-depan.png`, `/kartu-belakang-kosong.png`), unique Customer ID, and dynamic QR code completely intact without layout changes.\n   - Do not add any external npm dependencies.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_end: 91
