  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Fixing UI Overflows**\n\nI\'m currently focused on fixing UI overflows in `/app/page.tsx`. I\'m using `multi_replace_file_content` to adjust the CSS styling of the stamp containers, specifically the `<button>` and inner `<div>`, by setting `overflow-visible` and removing `overflow-hidden`. This should prevent unintended clipping of stamp images.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_343330"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Update stamp slot containers and <img> tags to use w-full h-full object-contain, overflow-visible, and inner padding so stamp artwork (including top coffee steam) scales proportionally without any cropping.\", \"Instruction\":\"Fix the CSS styling for the dynamic stamp icons on the back face of the card so the entire image scales proportionally inside its grid slot without cropping.\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":809, \"ReplacementContent\":\"    positions.forEach((pos, idx) => {\\n      const slot = document.createElement(\'div\');\\n      slot.style.gridRowStart = pos.r;\\n      slot.style.gridColumnStart = pos.c;\\n      slot.style.position = \'relative\';\\n      slot.style.overflow = \'visible\';\\n      slot.style.padding = \'8%\';\\n      slot.style.display = \'flex\';\\n      slot.style.alignItems = \'center\';\\n      slot.style.justifyContent = \'center\';\\n      if (idx < ${activeCustomer.currentStamps}) {\\n        const img = document.createElement(\'img\');\\n        img.src = idx % 2 === 0 ? \'/stamp-roti.png\' : \'/stamp-kopi.png\';\\n        img.style.width = \'100%\';\\n        img.style.height = \'100%\';\\n        img.style.objectFit = \'contain\';\\n        img.style.display = \'block\';\\n        slot.appendChild(img);\\n      }\\n      grid.appendChild(slot);\\n    });\", \"StartLine\":793, \"TargetContent\":\"    positions.forEach((pos, idx) => {\\n      const slot = document.createElement(\'div\');\\n      slot.style.gridRowStart = pos.r;\\n      slot.style.gridColumnStart = pos.c;\\n      slot.style.position = \'relative\';\\n      if (idx < ${activeCustomer.currentStamps}) {\\n        const img = document.createElement(\'img\');\\n        img.src = idx % 2 === 0 ? \'/stamp-roti.png\' : \'/stamp-kopi.png\';\\n        img.style.width = \'110%\';\\n        img.style.height = \'110%\';\\n        img.style.objectFit = \'contain\';\\n        slot.appendChild(img);\\n      }\\n      grid.appendChild(slot);\\n    });\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":1291, \"ReplacementContent\":\"                          <div\\n                            className=\\\"absolute z-10 grid grid-cols-5 grid-rows-2 overflow-visible\\\"\\n                            style={{\\n                              left: \'14.45%\',\\n                              top: \'31.06%\',\\n                              width: \'71.07%\',\\n                              height: \'44.20%\',\\n                              columnGap: \'4.15%\',\\n                              rowGap: \'14.80%\',\\n                            }}\\n                          >\\n                            {STAMP_SLOTS.map((slot, index) => {\\n                              const isStamped =\\n                                slot.index <= activeCustomer.currentStamps;\\n                              const stampSrc =\\n                                index % 2 === 0\\n                                  ? \'/stamp-roti.png\'\\n                                  : \'/stamp-kopi.png\';\\n                              return (\\n                                <button\\n                                  key={slot.index}\\n                                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                  onClick={(e) =>\\n                                    setExactStampCount(\\n                                      activeCustomer.id,\\n                                      slot.index,\\n                                      e\\n                                    )\\n                                  }\\n                                  title={`${t.toggleStampTitle}${slot.index}`}\\n                                  aria-label={`Stamp circle ${slot.index}`}\\n                                  className={`${slot.gridClass} relative w-full h-full rounded-full overflow-visible p-[8%] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#4A4928] transition-transform active:scale-95`}\\n                                >\\n                                  {isStamped && (\\n                                    <div className=\\\"w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-visible\\\">\\n                                      <img\\n                                        src={stampSrc}\\n                                        alt={`Stamp ${slot.index}`}\\n                                        style={{ objectFit: \'contain\' }}\\n                                        className=\\\"w-full h-full max-w-full max-h-full object-contain pointer-events-none select-none transition-all duration-300 scale-100 block\\\"\\n                                      />\\n                                    </div>\\n                                  )}\\n                                </button>\\n                              );\\n                            })}\\n                          </div>\", \"StartLine\":1246, \"TargetContent\":\"                          <div\\n                            className=\\\"absolute z-10 grid grid-cols-5 grid-rows-2\\\"\\n                            style={{\\n                              left: \'14.45%\',\\n                              top: \'31.06%\',\\n                              width: \'71.07%\',\\n                              height: \'44.20%\',\\n                              columnGap: \'4.15%\',\\n                              rowGap: \'14.80%\',\\n                            }}\\n                          >\\n                            {STAMP_SLOTS.map((slot, index) => {\\n                              const isStamped =\\n                                slot.index <= activeCustomer.currentStamps;\\n                              const stampSrc =\\n                                index % 2 === 0\\n                                  ? \'/stamp-roti.png\'\\n                                  : \'/stamp-kopi.png\';\\n                              return