  planner_response {
    response: "The CSS styling for the dynamic stamp icons on the back face of the card has been updated to prevent any cropping:\n\n- **Proportional Scaling (`object-fit: contain`)**: Replaced the oversized `w-[110%] h-[110%]` sizing on the stamp `<img>` tags with `w-full h-full max-w-full max-h-full object-contain` (`style={{ objectFit: \'contain\' }}`) inside a centered flex wrapper so the entire stamp artwork scales proportionally without cutting off the top or edges.\n- **Unclipped Overflow (`overflow-visible`)**: Explicitly set `overflow-visible` on the stamp grid container, individual stamp slot buttons, and inner image wrappers so no artwork is clipped by slot bounds.\n- **Inner Circle Padding (`p-[8%]`)**: Added transparent inner padding (`p-[8%]`) to each stamp container (and regenerated `/stamp-kopi.png` and `/stamp-roti.png` with full uncropped margins) so each stamp sits cleanly inside its circle without touching the edges."
