    user_response: "Refactor ONLY the visual styling and CSS theme of the application and B2B Dashboard to match the Apple Cupertino Dark Mode & Bento Grid aesthetic. \n\nCRITICAL RULE \342\200\224 ZERO FUNCTIONAL OR STRUCTURAL CHANGES:\n- DO NOT remove, replace, or alter any existing features, state logic, `localStorage` anonymous ID persistence, PWA setup, dynamic QR code generation, search/filter inputs, or customer data tables.\n- DO NOT turn the page into a marketing landing page or add product hardware silhouettes. Keep the exact same workspace layout, view switchers, and 3D loyalty card functionality.\n- DO NOT touch the custom Sissi 3D Loyalty Card artwork (`/kartu-depan.png`, `/kartu-belakang-kosong.png`, `/stamp-roti.png`, `/stamp-kopi.png`), gyroscope physics, or flip animations.\n\nAPPLY THESE EXACT APPLE CUPERTINO VISUAL TOKENS:\n\n1. Global Canvas & Typography:\n   - Main background: Pure pitch-black OLED `#000000`.\n   - Font stack: `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Display\", \"SF Pro Text\", \"Inter\", sans-serif` with `-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased`.\n   - Primary text: `#F5F5F7` | Muted/Secondary text & labels: `#86868B`.\n   - Headings: `font-semibold`, tight tracking `tracking-[-0.025em]`, `leading-[1.06]`.\n\n2. Apple Ultra-Minimalist Top Navigation Bar:\n   - Style the top header bar as an Apple glass navbar: height `h-11` (`44px`), `sticky top-0 z-50`, background `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78)` with `backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px)`, and a subtle bottom border `border-b border-white/[0.08]`.\n   - Navigation switcher links: micro-typography `text-[12px] font-normal tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#F5F5F7]/80 hover:text-white transition-colors`.\n\n3. Apple Bento Grid Metric Cards (B2B Dashboard):\n   - Style the 4 summary metric containers as dark glass Bento cards: `bg-[#161618] rounded-[24px] p-6 border border-white/[0.06] shadow-2xl`.\n   - Metric numbers: monumental Apple typography (`text-[40px] md:text-[48px] font-semibold tracking-tight leading-none`).\n   - Apply subtle Apple metallic/cyan gradients (`bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-[#F5F5F7] to-[#86868B] bg-clip-text text-transparent` or cyan/emerald accents for active claims) to the large metric numbers.\n\n4. Apple Capsule Buttons & Controls:\n   - Primary action buttons (e.g., \"+1 Stempel\", primary actions): Apple Blue solid capsule `bg-[#0071E3] hover:bg-[#0077ED] text-white text-[13px] font-normal tracking-[-0.01em] px-[18px] py-[8px] rounded-full transition-all`.\n   - Secondary/Filter buttons & view toggles: Translucent capsule `bg-[#161618] hover:bg-[#2C2C2E] text-[#F5F5F7] border border-white/[0.08] text-[13px] px-[16px] py-[7px] rounded-full` (active state: `border-[#2997FF] text-[#2997FF]`).\n\n5. Search Input & B2B Data Table (GlassOS Style):\n   - Search bar: `bg-[#161618] border border-white/[0.08] focus:border-[#0071E3] rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-[14px] text-[#F5F5F7] placeholder-[#86868B] outline-none transition-all`.\n   - Customer Table Container: Wrap inside a clean Bento surface `bg-[#161618] rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.06] overflow-hidden`.\n   - Table Headers: `text-[12px] font-medium text-[#86868B] border-b border-white/[0.06] uppercase tracking-wider`.\n   - Table Rows: `border-b border-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors text-[14px] text-[#F5F5F7]`."
    items {
      text: "Refactor ONLY the visual styling and CSS theme of the application and B2B Dashboard to match the Apple Cupertino Dark Mode & Bento Grid aesthetic. \n\nCRITICAL RULE \342\200\224 ZERO FUNCTIONAL OR STRUCTURAL CHANGES:\n- DO NOT remove, replace, or alter any existing features, state logic, `localStorage` anonymous ID persistence, PWA setup, dynamic QR code generation, search/filter inputs, or customer data tables.\n- DO NOT turn the page into a marketing landing page or add product hardware silhouettes. Keep the exact same workspace layout, view switchers, and 3D loyalty card functionality.\n- DO NOT touch the custom Sissi 3D Loyalty Card artwork (`/kartu-depan.png`, `/kartu-belakang-kosong.png`, `/stamp-roti.png`, `/stamp-kopi.png`), gyroscope physics, or flip animations.\n\nAPPLY THESE EXACT APPLE CUPERTINO VISUAL TOKENS:\n\n1. Global Canvas & Typography:\n   - Main background: Pure pitch-black OLED `#000000`.\n   - Font stack: `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Display\", \"SF Pro Text\", \"Inter\", sans-serif` with `-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased`.\n   - Primary text: `#F5F5F7` | Muted/Secondary text & labels: `#86868B`.\n   - Headings: `font-semibold`, tight tracking `tracking-[-0.025em]`, `leading-[1.06]`.\n\n2. Apple Ultra-Minimalist Top Navigation Bar:\n   - Style the top header bar as an Apple glass navbar: height `h-11` (`44px`), `sticky top-0 z-50`, background `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78)` with `backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px)`, and a subtle bottom border `border-b border-white/[0.08]`.\n   - Navigation switcher links: micro-typography `text-[12px] font-normal tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#F5F5F7]/80 hover:text-white transition-colors`.\n\n3. Apple Bento Grid Metric Cards (B2B Dashboard):\n   - Style the 4 summary metric containers as dark glass Bento cards: `bg-[#161618] rounded-[24px] p-6 border border-white/[0.06] shadow-2xl`.\n   - Metric numbers: monumental Apple typography (`text-[40px] md:text-[48px] font-semibold tracking-tight leading-none`).\n   - Apply subtle Apple metallic/cyan gradients (`bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-[#F5F5F7] to-[#86868B] bg-clip-text text-transparent` or cyan/emerald accents for active claims) to the large metric numbers.\n\n4. Apple Capsule Buttons & Controls:\n   - Primary action buttons (e.g., \"+1 Stempel\", primary actions): Apple Blue solid capsule `bg-[#0071E3] hover:bg-[#0077ED] text-white text-[13px] font-normal tracking-[-0.01em] px-[18px] py-[8px] rounded-full transition-all`.\n   - Secondary/Filter buttons & view toggles: Translucent capsule `bg-[#161618] hover:bg-[#2C2C2E] text-[#F5F5F7] border border-white/[0.08] text-[13px] px-[16px] py-[7px] rounded-full` (active state: `border-[#2997FF] text-[#2997FF]`).\n\n5. Search Input & B2B Data Table (GlassOS Style):\n   - Search bar: `bg-[#161618] border border-white/[0.08] focus:border-[#0071E3] rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-[14px] text-[#F5F5F7] placeholder-[#86868B] outline-none transition-all`.\n   - Customer Table Container: Wrap inside a clean Bento surface `bg-[#161618] rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.06] overflow-hidden`.\n   - Table Headers: `text-[12px] font-medium text-[#86868B] border-b border-white/[0.06] uppercase tracking-wider`.\n   - Table Rows: `border-b border-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors text-[14px] text-[#F5F5F7]`."
