  planner_response {
    response: "The application and B2B Dashboard have been restyled with the **Apple Cupertino Dark Mode & Bento Grid** aesthetic while preserving all existing functionality, state logic, and the custom Sissi 3D Loyalty Card artwork:\n\n- **Global OLED Canvas & Typography**: Set the root canvas to `#000000` with `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Display\", \"SF Pro Text\", \"Inter\", sans-serif` (`-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased`), primary text `#F5F5F7`, muted labels `#86868B`, and tight heading tracking (`tracking-[-0.025em] leading-[1.06]`).\n- **Apple Glass Navigation Bar**: Styled the sticky header at `h-11` (`44px`) with `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78)`, `backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px)`, `border-b border-white/[0.08]`, and `12px` micro-typography links.\n- **Bento Grid Metric Cards**: Restyled the 4 B2B dashboard summary metrics into dark glass Bento surfaces (`bg-[#161618] rounded-[24px] p-6 border border-white/[0.06] shadow-2xl`) with monumental `40px`/`48px` typography and metallic, cyan, and emerald gradients.\n- **Apple Capsule Controls & GlassOS Table**: Applied solid Apple Blue capsules (`bg-[#0071E3] hover:bg-[#0077ED] rounded-full`) for primary actions, translucent `#161618` capsules (`border-[#2997FF] text-[#2997FF]` when active) for filters and view switchers, a pill-shaped search input, and a `rounded-[24px]` GlassOS data table container."
    modified_response: "The application and B2B Dashboard have been restyled with the **Apple Cupertino Dark Mode & Bento Grid** aesthetic while preserving all existing functionality, state logic, and the custom Sissi 3D Loyalty Card artwork:\n\n- **Global OLED Canvas & Typography**: Set the root canvas to `#000000` with `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Display\", \"SF Pro Text\", \"Inter\", sans-serif` (`-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased`), primary text `#F5F5F7`, muted labels `#86868B`, and tight heading tracking (`tracking-[-0.025em] leading-[1.06]`).\n- **Apple Glass Navigation Bar**: Styled the sticky header at `h-11` (`44px`) with `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78)`, `backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px)`, `border-b border-white/[0.08]`, and `12px` micro-typography links.\n- **Bento Grid Metric Cards**: Restyled the 4 B2B dashboard summary metrics into dark glass Bento surfaces (`bg-[#161618] rounded-[24px] p-6 border border-white/[0.06] shadow-2xl`) with monumental `40px`/`48px` typography and metallic, cyan, and emerald gradients.\n- **Apple Capsule Controls & GlassOS Table**: Applied solid Apple Blue capsules (`bg-[#0071E3] hover:bg-[#0077ED] rounded-full`) for primary actions, translucent `#161618` capsules (`border-[#2997FF] text-[#2997FF]` when active) for filters and view switchers, a pill-shaped search input, and a `rounded-[24px]` GlassOS data table container."
