  user_input {
    user_response: "Create a new feature for the B2B Cashier side and update the QR logic. Keep all current Apple Cupertino UI styling intact.\n\n1. Update QR Code Payload: Change the QR code `data` payload on the back of the 3D card. Instead of pointing to an external API, make it point to an internal route for the cashier: `https://app.sissiheritage.com/kasir?id=${activeCustomer.id}` (use this dummy domain for the preview).\n2. Create Cashier Portal Page (`/kasir` route): Build a new page that acts as the destination when the cashier scans the customer\'s QR. \n3. Cashier UI (Apple Minimalist Mobile-First):\n   - Read and display the `id` from the URL query parameter (e.g., \"Pelanggan: VSP-1533-220Y\").\n   - Display a simulated existing stamp count (e.g., \"Stempel Aktif: 6/8\").\n   - Add a form section titled \"Input Pesanan Baru\".\n   - Include Quick Select checkboxes or pill-toggles for frequent items: \"Iced Latte\", \"Hot Cappuccino\", \"Butter Croissant\", \"Almond Croissant\".\n   - Include a Text Area for \"Catatan Khusus (Alergi/Preferensi)\" with a placeholder \"Misal: Oatmilk, less sugar...\".\n   - Add a primary Apple blue capsule button (`#0071E3`) at the bottom: \"Submit Pesanan & +1 Stempel\".\n4. Ensure this new page uses the same dark OLED background (`#000000`) and clean Bento glass containers (`bg-[#161618]`) as the rest of the app."
    items {
      text: "Create a new feature for the B2B Cashier side and update the QR logic. Keep all current Apple Cupertino UI styling intact.\n\n1. Update QR Code Payload: Change the QR code `data` payload on the back of the 3D card. Instead of pointing to an external API, make it point to an internal route for the cashier: `https://app.sissiheritage.com/kasir?id=${activeCustomer.id}` (use this dummy domain for the preview).\n2. Create Cashier Portal Page (`/kasir` route): Build a new page that acts as the destination when the cashier scans the customer\'s QR. \n3. Cashier UI (Apple Minimalist Mobile-First):\n   - Read and display the `id` from the URL query parameter (e.g., \"Pelanggan: VSP-1533-220Y\").\n   - Display a simulated existing stamp count (e.g., \"Stempel Aktif: 6/8\").\n   - Add a form section titled \"Input Pesanan Baru\".\n   - Include Quick Select checkboxes or pill-toggles for frequent items: \"Iced Latte\", \"Hot Cappuccino\", \"Butter Croissant\", \"Almond Croissant\".\n   - Include a Text Area for \"Catatan Khusus (Alergi/Preferensi)\" with a placeholder \"Misal: Oatmilk, less sugar...\".\n   - Add a primary Apple blue capsule button (`#0071E3`) at the bottom: \"Submit Pesanan & +1 Stempel\".\n4. Ensure this new page uses the same dark OLED background (`#000000`) and clean Bento glass containers (`bg-[#161618]`) as the rest of the app."
    }
  }
}
