    response: "The B2B Cashier Portal feature and QR code payload have been implemented while keeping the Apple Cupertino Dark Mode & Bento Grid aesthetic intact:\n\n- **Updated QR Code Payload**: The dynamic QR code on the back of the 3D card now encodes `https://app.sissiheritage.com/kasir?id=${activeCustomer.id}`.\n- **Cashier Portal Page (`/kasir`)**: Created a mobile-first B2B Cashier Portal route (`/kasir`) with a pitch-black OLED canvas (`#000000`), Apple glass top bar, and dark Bento containers (`bg-[#161618] rounded-[24px]`).\n- **Customer & Stamp Status**: Reads the `id` query parameter (e.g., `Pelanggan: VSP-1533-220Y`), displays the active stamp counter (`Stempel Aktif: 6/8`) with an interactive 8-stamp preview grid, and syncs updates when orders are submitted.\n- **\"Input Pesanan Baru\" Order Form**: Includes quick-select pill checkboxes for `\"Iced Latte\"`, `\"Hot Cappuccino\"`, `\"Butter Croissant\"`, and `\"Almond Croissant\"`, a `\"Catatan Khusus (Alergi/Preferensi)\"` textarea (`placeholder=\"Misal: Oatmilk, less sugar...\"`), and a full-width Apple Blue capsule submit button (`\"Submit Pesanan & +1 Stempel\"`)."
